<title>KAZAKHSTAN: Kazakh tenge rises to 74.7400 to dlr.</title>
<headline>Kazakh tenge rises to 74.7400 to dlr.</headline>
<dateline>ALMATY 1997-05-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The tenge closed at 74.7400 per dollar on the Kazakhstan Currency Exchange on Sunday after 75.4600 on Wednesday.</p>
<p> TENGE PER DOLLAR	     May 4		   Apr 30</p>
<p> High			     75.1600		 75.6000</p>
<p> Low				74.7000		 75.1000</p>
<p> Open			     75.1500		 75.1000</p>
<p> Close			    74.7400		 75.4600</p>
<p> Volume ($ million)		  5.095		   2.450</p>
<p>--Almaty Newsroom, + 7 3272 509410</p>
